..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : SERHISTORIE.TAB
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Zeilen-FOP, wertet jeweils eine LS-Position aus
.. Functionality  : Row efop, analyses one delivery note row on each entry
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. wrong service product?
.. The service product can be assigned directly in a sales item (row), or it
.. can be assigned in the materials allocation table.
.. If the service product is neither found in the sales item, nor in the
.. materials allocation, the infosystem does not create a row.
.continue MZPRUEF  ?  F|empty(H|serprod)
.continue SHOW     ?  H|serprod^id = M|kprodukt^id
.continue END
!MZPRUEF
.type text xtsel  ? _F|defined(U|xtsel)
.formula U|xtsel = "$,,;abeweg=" + H|id + ";serprod=" + M|kprodukt^id    ?  H|mge > 0
.formula U|xtsel = "$,,;zbeweg=" + H|id + ";serprod=" + M|kprodukt^id    ?  H|mge < 0
.load 1 mallocation 'U|xtsel'
.continue END     ? _G|mehr
..
!SHOW: create new row
.make screen line +O
..
.. head information
.copy M|tls      = H|kopf
.copy M|tauftrag = H|okopf
.formula M|tvom       = H|kopf^vom
.copy M|tkunde   = H|kopf^kunde
.copy M|tkunde2  = H|kopf^reempf
.copy M|tkunde3  = H|kopf^warenempf
..
.. item information
.copy M|tlspos = H|id
.formula M|ttterm   = H|tterm
.copy M|tartex = H|artex
.formula M|tmge = H|mge
.formula M|the  = H|he
.formula M|tmge = 1|zuomge  ?  F|defined(1|zuomge)
.formula M|the  = 1|einh    ?  F|defined(1|einh)
..
.. delivery or return: show arrow icon
.formula M|trichtung = M|klieferz  ?  H|mge > 0
.formula M|trichtung = M|krueckz   ?  H|mge < 0
..
.. release buffer with materials allocation
.. .lade 1  ?  F|defined(1|id)
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
